---
source: tui/src/chatwidget/realtime/recording_controls_tests.rs
expression: "states.join(\"\\n\\n\")"
---
connecting:
› Ask Codex to do anything

   voice ◌ connecting   /voice stop   /voice mute ctrl+x

listening:
› Ask Codex to do anything

   voice ● listening   /voice stop   mic ⠄⠄  codex ⠄⠄   /voice mute ctrl+x

speaking:
› Ask Codex to do anything

   voice ● speaking   /voice stop   mic ⣿⣿  codex ⣿⣿   /voice mute ctrl+x

muted:
› Ask Codex to do anything

   voice ◌ muted   /voice stop   mic off  codex ⣿⣿   /voice mute ctrl+x

transcript:
› Ask Codex to do anything

   voice ● speaking   /voice stop   mic ⣤⣤  codex ⣤⣤   /voice mute ctrl+x

interrupted:
› Ask Codex to do anything

   voice ● heard   /voice stop   mic ⣤⣤  codex ⠄⠄   /voice mute ctrl+x
